din, inside Uldaman"},[11]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2201,["level"]=43,["liveXPFallback"]=3600,["name"]="Find the Gems",["note"]="The ruby, sapphire and topaz are in chests across Uldaman; one of them is in Ironaya's chamber.",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Find the ruby, sapphire, and topaz that are scattered throughout Uldaman. Once acquired, contact Talvash del Kissel remotely by using the Phial of Scrying he previously gave you.  From the journal, you know... * The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area. * The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.  * The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",["required"]=37,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Remains of a Paladin, inside Uldaman",["turnin"]="Talvash's Scrying Bowl, inside Uldaman"},[12]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2204,["level"]=44,["liveXPFallback"]=930,["name"]="Restoring the Necklace",["note"]="The power source is the Shattered Necklace Power Source from Archaedas.",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Obtain a power source from the most powerful construct you can find in Uldaman, and deliver it to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge.",["required"]=37,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Talvash's Scrying Bowl, inside Uldaman",["turnin"]="Talvash del Kissel, Ironforge (36.4, 3.6)"},[13]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2361,["level"]=44,["liveXPFallback"]=5600,["name"]="Restoring the Necklace",["noteRewards"]={},["required"]=37,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=7673,["name"]="Talvash's Enhancing Necklace",["quality"]=3}},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Talvash del Kissel, Ironforge (36.4, 3.6)",["turnin"]="Talvash del Kissel, Ironforge"},[14]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2283,["level"]=41,["liveXPFallback"]=2450,["name"]="Necklace Recovery",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Look for a valuable necklace within the Uldaman dig site and bring it back to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar. The necklace may be damaged.",["required"]=37,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Dran Droffers, Orgrimmar (59.5, 36.6)",["turnin"]="Dran Droffers, Orgrimmar"},[15]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2284,["level"]=41,["liveXPFallback"]=2450,["name"]="Necklace Recovery, Take 2",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Find a clue as to the gems' whereabouts in the depths of Uldaman.",["required"]=37,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Dran Droffers, Orgrimmar (59.5, 36.6)",["turnin"]="Remains of a Paladin, inside Uldaman"},[16]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2339,["level"]=44,["liveXPFallback"]=3750,["name"]="Find the Gems and Power Source",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.  From the journal, you know... * The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area. * The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves. * The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.",["required"]=37,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Jarkal Mossmeld, Badlands (2.4, 46.1)",["turnin"]="Jarkal Mossmeld, Badlands"},[17]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=2418,["level"]=36,["liveXPFallback"]=3500,["name"]="Power Stones",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands.",["required"]=30,["rewardChoice"]=true,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=9522,["name"]="Energized Stone Circle",["quality"]=2},[2]={["id"]=10358,["name"]="Duracin Bracers",["quality"]=2},[3]={["id"]=10359,["name"]="Everlast Boots",["quality"]=2},[4]={["id"]=270055,["name"]="Charged Leather Bracers",["quality"]=2}},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Rigglefuzz, Badlands (42.4, 52.9)",["turnin"]="Rigglefuzz, Badlands"},[18]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=709,["level"]=40,["liveXPFallback"]=3150,["name"]="Solution to Doom",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Br