the Damned's school of necromancy in the crypts beneath Caer Darrow. Darkmaster Gandling teaches the dark arts. Needs the Skeleton Key.",["icon"]="Interface\\Icons\\INV_Misc_Bone_Skull_01",["instanceID"]=289,["key"]="scholo",["level"]="58-60",["mapX"]=69.7,["mapY"]=73.2,["mapZone"]="Western Plaguelands",["maxLevel"]=60,["minLevel"]=58,["name"]="Scholomance",["quests"]={[1]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5529,["level"]=58,["liveXPFallback"]=6200,["name"]="Plagued Hatchlings",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel.",["required"]=55,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Betina Bigglezink, Eastern Plaguelands (71.7, 49.9)",["turnin"]="Betina Bigglezink, Eastern Plaguelands"},[10]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5505,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=9950,["name"]="The Key to Scholomance",["noteRewards"]={},["required"]=55,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=13704,["name"]="Skeleton Key",["quality"]=1}},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands (42.7, 83.8)",["turnin"]="Alchemist Arbington, Western Plaguelands"},[11]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5511,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=9950,["name"]="The Key to Scholomance",["noteRewards"]={},["required"]=55,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=13704,["name"]="Skeleton Key",["quality"]=1}},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="High Executor Derrington, Tirisfal Glades (83.1, 68.9)",["turnin"]="High Executor Derrington, Tirisfal Glades"},[12]={["alsoRewards"]={},["class"]="WARLOCK",["id"]=7629,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=6600,["name"]="Imp Delivery",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance. After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",["required"]=60,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes, Burning Steppes (12.4, 31.6)",["turnin"]="Gorzeeki Wildeyes, Burning Steppes"},[13]={["alsoRewards"]={},["class"]="PALADIN",["id"]=7647,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=9950,["name"]="Judgment and Redemption",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver. Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.  Give the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",["required"]=60,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker, Stormwind City (48.4, 50.2)",["turnin"]="Darkreaver's Fallen Charger, inside Scholomance"},[14]={["alsoRewards"]={},["class"]="SHAMAN",["id"]=8258,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=9950,["name"]="The Darkreaver Menace",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.  Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",["required"]=60,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=20134,["name"]="Skyfury Helm",["quality"]=4}},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Sagorne Creststrider, Orgrimmar (38.7, 35.9)",["turnin"]="Sagorne Creststrider, Orgrimmar"},[15]={["alsoRewards"]={},["class"]="SHAMAN",["id"]=7668,["level"]=60,["name"]="The Darkreaver Menace",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.",["required"]=58,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=18807,["name"]="Helm of Latent Power",["quality"]=3}},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Sagorne Creststrider, Orgrimmar (38.7, 35.9)",["turnin"]="Sagorne Creststrider, Orgrimmar"},[16]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5531,["level"]=60,["name"]="Betina Bigglezink",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Bring the Frozen Eggs to Betina Bigglezink.",["required"]=57,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Leonid Barthalomew the Revered, Eastern Plaguelands (71.9, 48.3)",["turnin"]="Betina Bigglezink, Eastern Plaguelands"},[2]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5582,["level"]=58,["name"]="Healthy Dragon Scale",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands.",["required"]=55,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Healthy Dragon Scale, dropped by Plagued Hatchling",["turnin"]="Betina Bigglezink, Eastern Plaguelands (71.7, 49.9)"},[3]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5341,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=6600,["name"]="Barov Family Fortune",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.",["required"]=52,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Horde",["starts"]="Alexi Barov, Tirisfal Glades (83.1, 71.6)",["turnin"]="Alexi Barov, Tirisfal Glades"},[4]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5343,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=6600,["name"]="Barov Family Fortune",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.",["required"]=52,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Alliance",["starts"]="Weldon Barov, Western Plaguelands (43.5, 83.7)",["turnin"]="Weldon Barov, Western Plaguelands"},[5]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5382,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=6600,["name"]="Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete. ",["required"]=55,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands (70.2, 73.7)",["turnin"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands"},[6]={["alsoRewards"]={},["id"]=5515,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=6600,["name"]="Krastinov's Bag of Horrors",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Locate Jandice Barov in the Scholomance and destroy her. From her corpse recover Krastinov's Bag of Horrors. Return the bag to Eva Sarkhoff.",["required"]=55,["rewards"]={},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands (70.2, 73.7)",["turnin"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands"},[7]={["alsoRewards"]={[1]={["id"]=13544,["name"]="Spectral Essence",["quality"]=2}},["id"]=5384,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=8300,["name"]="Kirtonos the Herald",["note"]="Place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier on the porch to summon Kirtonos.",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.  Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff. ",["required"]=55,["rewardChoice"]=true,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=15805,["name"]="Penelope's Rose",["quality"]=3},[2]={["id"]=15806,["name"]="Mirah's Song",["quality"]=3}},["side"]="Both",["starts"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands (70.2, 73.7)",["turnin"]="Eva Sarkhoff, Western Plaguelands"},[8]={["alsoRewards"]={[1]={["id"]=14002,["name"]="Darrowshire Strongguard",["quality"]=3}},["id"]=5466,["level"]=60,["liveXPFallback"]=9950,["name"]="The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper",["noteRewards"]={},["objective"]="Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.",["required"]=57,["rewardChoice"]=true,["rewards"]={[1]={["id"]=13982,["name"]="Warblade of Caer Darrow",["quality"]=3},[2]={["id"]=13986,["name"]="Crown of Caer Darrow",["qual